   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Hmph! Looks like that thing's ready[n]to rumble.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "DVL_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shadow's Voice",
   "en": "Accept yourself... Our lord laments the[n]foolishness birthed from your pain.",
