   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Where are these voices...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "(SE)女の声その2",
   "en": "Her whole \"I'm not[n]bothered\" routine really[n]pisses me off sometimes.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "(SE)女の声その2",
   "en": "Getting special treatment is like,[n]whatever if it's deserved, but do[n]YOU think she's earned it?",
