   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "That's...!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "(SE)男の声その2",
   "en": "I understand how you feel, but...[n]Well, third place doesn't really[n]cut it in this case...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "(SE)男の声その2",
   "en": "She needs to attain first-place results[n]for her exceptional status to be[n]worthwhile.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "......!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "(SE)男の声その3",
   "en": "Not only have we lost one of them, but[n]the other one's not doing us any good.[n]Talk about a waste of effort...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "I've had enough of this...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
