   "en": "Yoshizawa!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "You're telling me I'm not cutting it?[n]As if I don't know that better than[n]anyone!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_5_0#1",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "Still...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "I don't care what anyone says[n]about me...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "I will NOT tolerate anyone speaking ill[n]of our dream!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
